    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Painted bedroom with blue walls, green-pink floor, wooden bed and chairs, open window, and framed pictures.",
      "long": "A vividly colored painted room interior: blue walls with vertical texture, a floor composed of diagonal green, pink, and gray strokes suggesting wood planks. A large wooden bed with white linens and a red blanket dominates the right side. Two matching wooden chairs with woven seats flank a small table holding a ceramic pitcher, basin, glass bottles, and stacked books. On the left wall, a green-framed window with yellow panes is open; nearby, garments hang on wall pegs and a striped towel hangs from a hook. Several small framed artworks—including a landscape and portraits—are hung unevenly on the wall above the bed.",
